ION\"", 443], ["\"OFFSITE INJURY\"", 334], ["\"OUTBURST\"", 197]], "date_fmt": null}, "INVEST_BEGIN_DT": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 8684, "blank": 218936, "top": [["\"10/04/2001\"", 143], ["\"07/05/2005\"", 143], ["\"07/23/2009\"", 109], ["\"02/14/2003\"", 109], ["\"02/07/2009\"", 109], ["\"09/05/2001\"", 109], ["\"09/10/2001\"", 108], ["\"01/05/2006\"", 100], ["\"02/26/2007\"", 100], ["\"12/18/2008\"", 100], ["\"08/30/2000\"", 100]], "date_fmt": null}, "NARRATIVE": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 270804, "blank": 2, "top": [["\"On night shift of September 16th, a NSMS production loader operator was remote mucking the final firing of the BD 1184 100 P1 stope. While retreating with a full bucket, the stope brow failed back to the intersection, partially burying the loader. No personnel were in the vicinity of stope at the time. 800-1000 tons of material fell causing damage to front of mucker.\"", 329], ["\"The morning of 1-3-26 @ 4:15am Employee was working on 92-11 in H.E. shop bay S1. The employee was in the process of removing a wiggins oil line with a 1 5/8 wrench, the wrench was on the fitting and they let loose of the wrench to reposition their body and the wrench fell off and chipped a tooth.\"", 329], ["\"EE was using excavator to dig out a silt containment area when the bank gave way causing excavator to roll into hole. Excavator came to a stop with cab side down and operator was stuck inside. EMS arrived on scene and was able to extract EE and transport to area hospital.\"", 329], ["\"Attempting to fit controller cover on shearer when cover slipped from fingers, slick with silicone, and smashed down on his left wrist.\"", 329], ["\"EE was operating a scraper using the Push/pull technique and while doing so he ran over a rock and jarred his back. We took him into the doctor and he was put on restrictions of no lifting over 20 lbs and not sitting for longer than 20 min thus constituting in a MSHA reportable accident.\"", 329], ["\"EE reported he bumped right elbow on the railroad track while working on the bottom of a railcar.  EE advised that he now has a cyst about the size & shape of an egg on right elbow.  EE had an incident similar to this in January 2005 in which he treated with his personal physician on his own.  He stated that he had no problems with his elbow prior to 5/25/05.\"", 329], ["\"Employee was driving loader and felt pain in his lower abdomen.  Diagnosis:  Abdominal wall strain; Restricted duty and prescribed medications assigned.\"", 329], ["\"Employee was diagnosed with pneumoconiosis.\"", 329], ["\"While employee was operating the continuous miner in the #3 face a piece of rock was thrown back off the cutter head and struck the ee in the RT eye and nose. It was reported that the ee had his safety glasses on and they were knocked off and/or broken.\"", 329], ["\"A fall measuring approximately 18' W x 40' Long x 6' High occurred on section no. 4, entry 2.\"", 329], ["\"The employee was hanging line curtain in the number two entry, and as employee was lifting the curtain felt a strain in groin and back. The initial incident happened on 9/11/22 and the employee sought treatment on 9/19/22 and was taken off work by employee's physician on 9/26/22.\"", 329], ["\"EMPLOYEE WAS BOLTING UP STRAP & GOT HIS RT. INDEX FINGER CUT BY A PIECE OF ROCK THAT FELL HITTING HIS HAND.\"", 329]], "date_fmt": null}, "CLOSED_DOC_NO": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 122374, "blank": 152388, "top": [["\"320122220016\"", 147], ["\"320072960007\"", 147], ["\"320241370005\"", 147], ["\"320061310019\"", 147], ["\"320200990011\"", 147], ["\"320013440060\"", 147], ["\"320040990064\"", 147], ["\"320012880079\"", 147], ["\"320001170022\"", 147], ["\"320032120010\"", 147], ["\"320071280038\"", 147]], "date_fmt": null}, "COAL_METAL_IND": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 2, "blank": 0, "top": [["\"M\"", 145728], ["\"C\"", 127895]], "date_fmt": null}, "_INGESTED_AT": {"type": "TIMESTAMP_NTZ", "distinct": 1, "blank": 0, "top": [["2026-07-24 00:47